<title>SPAIN: Spain's Vitoria airport cargo doubled in September.</title>
<headline>Spain's Vitoria airport cargo doubled in September.</headline>
<dateline>VITORIA, Spain 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo traffic at Vitoria airport in northern Spain rose 97 percent in September to 2,184 tonnes from 1,110 tonnes in September 1995, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>This takes the nine month total to 16,780 tonnes from 7,258 tonnes last year. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
